---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const site = Astro.site ?? new URL('https://usdtoworld.com');
const breadcrumbSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: site.toString() },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Terms & Conditions', item: new URL('/terms', site).toString() },
  ],
};
---
<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | UsdtoWorld"
  description="The terms and conditions governing use of the UsdtoWorld currency converter website."
  path="/terms"
  schema={[breadcrumbSchema]}
>
  <div class="container page-hero">
    <Breadcrumbs trail={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Terms & Conditions', href: '/terms' }]} />
  </div>
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container prose">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="updated-note">Last updated: October 3, 2026</p>

      <div class="plain-summary">
        <strong>In plain terms:</strong> use UsdtoWorld freely for personal, informational conversions, don't
        misuse or scrape it, and don't treat anything here as financial advice. We may update these terms —
        continuing to use the site after a change means you accept the new version.
      </div>

      <h2>Acceptance of terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using UsdtoWorld (the "Site"), operated by UsdtoWorld from Indore, India, you
        agree to be bound by these Terms &amp; Conditions together with our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
        and <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>. If you do not agree, please stop using the Site.
      </p>

      <h2>What the Site offers</h2>
      <p>
        UsdtoWorld provides a free currency conversion tool and written guides to currency pairs such as USD to
        RMB, USD to INR and RUB to INR. The service is offered for personal, informational use. We may add, change
        or remove converters, pages or features at any time without notice.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>You agree not to misuse the Site. In particular, you will not:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>attempt to disrupt, overload or gain unauthorised access to the Site, its servers or its rate service;</li>
        <li>scrape or copy data at a rate or volume that degrades the service for other visitors, or resell the rates as your own data feed;</li>
        <li>use automated tools to submit the contact form, or use the form to send spam, malware or unlawful material;</li>
        <li>click on advertisements artificially or encourage others to do so, which breaches advertising network rules;</li>
        <li>use the Site for any unlawful purpose, including sanctions evasion or money laundering.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>No financial advice and accuracy of data</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on this Site constitutes financial, investment, tax or legal advice. Rates are mid-market reference
        figures from a third-party provider and can differ from what a bank or transfer service will offer; tables
        on guide pages are dated snapshots. You are responsible for checking the rate and total cost with your
        provider before you transact. See our full <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a> for details.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property and permitted use</h2>
      <p>
        The design, layout and original written content of this Site are owned by UsdtoWorld unless otherwise noted.
        You may view the pages, share links to them, and quote short excerpts with attribution and a link back.
        You may not republish substantial portions of our guides, or present our content as your own, without
        written permission. Exchange rate data is sourced from third-party providers and remains their property.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising and third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        The Site displays advertising supplied by Google AdSense and may link to third-party websites. We do not
        control those sites or the ads served by Google, and a link or advertisement is not an endorsement of any
        product or service. Your dealings with advertisers or third parties are between you and them.
      </p>

      <h2>Availability</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to keep UsdtoWorld available at all times but do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free access.
        The Site may be temporarily unavailable for maintenance, because a third-party rate provider is down, or
        because of factors outside our control. When live rates cannot be reached, the Site may show your last
        saved rate instead and will say so.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimer of warranties and limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is provided "as is" and "as available". To the fullest extent permitted by law, UsdtoWorld gives no
        warranty of accuracy, completeness or fitness for a particular purpose, and is not liable for any direct,
        indirect, incidental or consequential loss, including financial loss from a conversion or transfer decision,
        arising from your use of the Site.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes and termination</h2>
      <p>
        We may revise these Terms &amp; Conditions from time to time; the date at the top shows the latest version, and
        continued use of the Site after changes constitutes acceptance. We may restrict or block access for anyone
        who breaches these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India, with courts in Indore, Madhya Pradesh having jurisdiction. If any provision is found unenforceable, the rest remains in effect.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms can be sent via our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
